% Excluded from the packaged toolbox. Paths are relative to this folder,
% a bare folder name excludes everything under it, and this file excludes
% itself. Native executables are installed separately by MATLAB from the
% URLs in the toolbox metadata. Everything else is generated by examples.
bin
examples/runs
examples/dck/*.log
examples/dck/*.lst
examples/dck/*.tmp
examples/dck/*.PTI
